    "body": "Some minor things but otherwise LGTM!\r\n\r\nRegarding the deploy:\r\nAFAIK almost everybody running Linux today has some dbus implementation running.\r\nI think that deploying with `notify-rust` is better since Windows and macOS require nothing and anyone on Linux without dbus (which is highly unlikely because systemd requires dbus) can just build it themselves. ",
